<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-NOON RADIO HEADLINES - APRIL 7.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-NOON RADIO HEADLINES - APRIL 7.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Estonian Kuku radio at Noon. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>-The State audit office has told the defence ministry to increase control over its regional departments after the Rapla department broke budget regulations.</p>
<p>-The competition for the position for coach for the Kalev basketball team is becoming increasingly contoversial.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
